  "summary": "The experiment tested replacing the image encoder with ViT in a multiprofile multimodal model, achieving higher validation accuracy (0.7062) compared to the prior resnet50-based setup (0.6776). This suggests the image encoder's quality may contribute to performance, though other factors could also influence the outcome. Uncertainty remains about the exact contribution of ViT's representation capabilities versus other model components."
